                <pb facs="0270" n="185" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg185"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">422.11G93/1028: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Ecuador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hartman</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Quito</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-05-09T12:00:00-05:14"><hi rendition="#italic">May 9, 1919,
                                noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received May 10, 3.20
                            p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister of Finance informed me today that Ecuadorean Government remitted draft
                    yesterday to London 10,500 pounds sterling account service Guayaquil and Quito
                    Railway bonds.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hartman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
